{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3399c6604eb2bd1e3b8054cd55637358c750d033739281ead04324cfa79e2cbb", "ja": "（孤島サスペンスホラー映画の撮影も、大詰め。\n休憩時間に、エレナと浜辺を散歩することになった）", "zh": "（孤岛悬疑恐怖电影的拍摄也接近尾声了。休息时间，和艾蕾娜一起去海边散步。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "5cbc9daa9581cde4cab3b476a9cc9166ad9d9984edb6b0b294f6a085a11d659b", "ja": "ウーン、潮風って気持いいネ～♪\n撮影があとちょっとで終わっちゃうの、寂しいナ。", "zh": "嗯～，海风吹起来真舒服呀～♪\n拍摄再过一会儿就要结束了，真有点舍不得呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a3f55068601afa98121d9cba8eb3e88259f0236b4fead3a7a4cb2cd22b4e9987", "ja": "過ぎれば、あっという間だったな。\nタイトなスケジュールだったけど、疲れてないか？", "zh": "一结束才发现，时间过得真快啊。日程安排得很紧，你没累着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "446f9d29f006f9f7173ca6d824faf94676f655f8940db90d8e1fb4d7ba768753", "ja": "ワタシは大丈夫だヨー♪　それに、ホラー映画の\n撮影って、走ったり叫んだりして楽しいしネ！", "zh": "我没事哦♪　而且，拍恐怖电影时又要跑又要尖叫，很有意思嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c0c7a12abd8bc3ee8d6e4855a2df95eb6fcfc1c3baacac774ea29297c1d45a98", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nエレナは、ホラー映画とか好きなのか？", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n艾莱娜喜欢恐怖电影之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "6a1318efcd21f0593be1a1cb2ec5ebb903a6e51dd9dff4191e80bdc9a6722c32", "ja": "ううん、全然！　ワタシ、怖いの苦手だもん。だから\n最初に台本を読んだ時は、すっごく怖かったんだヨー。", "zh": "不是，完全不喜欢！我最怕恐怖的东西了。所以第一次读剧本的时候，真的特别害怕啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "b1954fb2fdad3339720cd7a2d581f95755c51854e643e06d0002849110a6f42a", "ja": "それに、怖がる演技とか初めてだったから……\nNGも、いっぱい出しちゃったしネ。", "zh": "而且，害怕的演技我也是第一次演……所以NG镜头也出了好多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "15de1c9b9e552aca6dec0d680285f05b1cea5fbf56bf76208c6a497c87fb6519", "ja": "お芝居はちょっと大変だったケド、その分\nちゃんとできた時は、すーっごくうれしかったヨ♪", "zh": "演戏虽然有点辛苦，但正因为这样，顺利完成的时候就特别特别开心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9fc1a310b99fb8937c136897a3cd750915c7c7162f1185c05e4a7e37b735578c", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n楽しんでやってくれてるなら、ありがたいよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n你能乐在其中，我就很欣慰了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "302463e17f0e7229b0ec6c7c110cc42b5a3ca81c0f29f90907949f155fec2537", "ja": "うん！　劇場のメンバーもいっぱいいて、\nずっと合宿してるみたいだったネ♪", "zh": "嗯！剧场里的成员也来了好多，\n感觉一直在合宿一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "c98750521390399a66c88464571d37075f62563709ce394c2cf1757e4d0aac46", "ja": "1日中ずーっと一緒だから、\nみんなと、もっと仲良くなれたヨ！", "zh": "因为1整天都一直在一起，\n所以和大家变得更要好了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1011_p", "source_sha256": "219e6f4f0607f4d84a150ee627bf52ad77e8e1bc53a7d48ef3766d44df068c8c", "ja": "それはよかった。茜と一緒のことが多かったけど、\nワガママに振り回されたりしなかったか？", "zh": "那就好。虽然大多时候都和茜在一起，\n但没被她的任性折腾得团团转吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "dfc68edb67c3966471db7a4703a127d5a893393418d2b53827bc7d0f0561c0b5", "ja": "大丈夫だヨ～。あ、でもシホといろいろ話した後かな？\nアカネ、急に寂しくなっちゃったみたいで……。", "zh": "没问题唷～。啊，不过好像是和志保聊过许多之后吧？\n茜突然变得很寂寞的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "9b21818b9febbb6231865cc4322561ca221e1eca17ee5241fb9d3856d6b202bc", "ja": "いつの間にか背中にピッタリくっついて来てたり、\nワタシのベッドで寝てたりしてたヨ♪", "zh": "不知不觉就紧紧贴到我后背上，\n还在我的床上睡着了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dbb05422fe238163354582256cd890f0b5e55c950f2c3dd85f7e64c9c63c321f", "ja": "そうか。あの時はああ言ってたけど、\n茜もホームシックにかかったのかもしれないな……。", "zh": "这样啊。虽然她当时是那么说的，但茜也可能是想家了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "5d756d52ecbde384024c24cd3d774e7219def259223f0ffa484be895abd2a5b9", "ja": "そうかも？　だから{$P$}、\nまた映画のお仕事、ワタシたちにさせてほしいナ♪", "zh": "也许吧？所以，{$P$}，以后也请让我们再接电影的工作吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "e30e8816595042efaef4c48d79f299cdcccd12551c649996aeaf17b046db1519", "ja": "みんなとずっと一緒にいられるし。\nそしたら、アカネもきっと寂しくないでショ？", "zh": "还能一直和大家在一起。\n这样的话，茜也一定不会寂寞了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1017_p", "source_sha256": "18c456a0a91819cde39e9dea82f4c796c16d62293580812645f3c1755460f872", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。またこんなふうに、\nみんなで仕事ができるようにしよう。約束だ！", "zh": "啊，是啊。以后也要继续像这样，\n让大家能一起工作。约好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "32f6ddebb9945f7ab1f5c26f5f21429a89b58c9a6f65630f34d43485ec6f6dc5", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}、\n約束だヨ～。エヘヘ♪", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}，说好了哦～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0173_1019_p", "source_sha256": "49d26c759dbd57245598d6d04994a3c7edc501da01f4b19d4ef02e4a0554b068", "ja": "（映画の撮影を通じて、エレナもみんなも少しずつ\n成長している。……うん、いい仕事になりそうだ！）", "zh": "（通过电影的拍摄，艾蕾娜和大家都在一点一点地成长。……嗯，看来会是一份很棒的工作！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
